    ✓ app  bundle
  +       create   jobs.bar
  +       create   pipelines.foo
          run      uploads the bundle's files
    ✓ notify  command
          run      runs ./ops/notify.sh 1001
    ✓ backfill  bundle.run
          run      runs jobs.backfill
